# Zoraline, Cosmos Caller: "Whenever Zoraline enters or attacks, you may pay {W}{B} and 2 life. When you do, return target
# nonland permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard ...". Turn 3 Bot2 Bolts her in response to her enters
# trigger. The trigger resolves anyway (it is not about her being there), Bot1 pays, and she is in the graveyard by then: a
# nonland permanent card with mana value 3, so a legal target. She returns with a finality counter - a new object (CR
# 400.7) that entered, so her trigger goes again; Bot1 declines it. 18 life.

